{"id":"Wb7702422c8e424830f7c6325","zh":"相关性分析","en":"","name":"相关性分析","language":"zh","domain":"文献术语","concept_id":null,"families":[],"definition_zh":null,"definition_en":null,"scope_note":null,"usage_note":null,"usage_overview":null,"translation_note":null,"usage_variants":[],"designations":[{"id":"Wb7702422c8e424830f7c6325","text":"相关性分析","language":"zh","role":"headword"}],"complete_examples":[{"id":"S3db21d2585cc2ad0b2be","source_id":"P121","page":2,"page_end":2,"language":"zh","text":"本文提出基于连续小波变换系数的轨道不平顺时频分析方法,考虑轨道动态几何形变中固定波形的影响,提取轨道不平顺的时频特性,能更为精细地提取轨道不平顺特征时频信号; 同时将对应区段车体振动加速度序列的小波变换时频分析结果与轨道不平顺信号进行比较分析,运用相关性分析方法提取对车体影响较大的特征频率及轨道不平顺类型。","citations":[{"source_id":"P121","page":2,"page_end":2}]},{"id":"Sfef6f18ab53b19893ba7","source_id":"P121","page":5,"page_end":5,"language":"zh","text":"从图6 可知: 不同类型轨道不平顺小波尺度系数与车体横向振动加速度的相关性分析结果同车体横向振动加速度的Fourier 谱分析结果基本一致,如在图6 (a) 所示的谱分布图中显著存在的 2.","citations":[{"source_id":"P121","page":5,"page_end":5}]}],"sources":{"P121":{"id":"P121","title":"基于小波的轨道不平顺和车体振动响应分析","authors":"宁迎智,周小林,徐庆元,徐磊,孟艺宸","year":"2013","doi":"10.19713/j.cnki.43-1423/u.2013.03.006","journal_citation":"铁道科学与工程学报","label":"宁迎智等（2013）","overview_slug":"2013-analysis-of-track-irregularity-and-car-body-vibration-response-based-on-wavelet-transform"}},"relations":[],"related_terms":[],"collocations":[],"symbols":[],"units":[],"formulas":[],"external_references":[],"suggested_comparisons":[],"contexts":[{"text":"比较各尺度不平顺系数与车体加速度序列的关联程度。","language":"zh","source_id":"P121","paper_slug":"2013-analysis-of-track-irregularity-and-car-body-vibration-response-based-on-wavelet-transform","title":"基于小波的轨道不平顺和车体振动响应分析","kind":"paper_usage"}],"word_links":[{"id":"Wbf850cc59a19dbf449f055c9","name":"Correlation analysis","language":"en","kind":"translation","label":"文献参考译法","reason":null}],"expression_links":[{"id":"Wbf850cc59a19dbf449f055c9","name":"Correlation analysis","language":"en","kind":"translation","label":"文献参考译法","reason":null}],"same_language_synonyms":[],"cro